Venera's change to NullMoth's metal2vulkan translator (LGPL-3.0-or-later, packaging/UPSTREAM's TRANSLATOR_COMMIT):
fold a function-constant-specialized AIR text before it is translated. Literal comparisons (at the type's width),
boolean operations on literals, the branches they decide, blocks nothing reaches, phi entries from removed edges,
single-entry phis and functions nothing reachable calls are folded away in the new translator/translator/src/fc_fold.rs,
called from specialize_air_function_constants once constants were supplied. tools/build-translator.sh applies this
patch (patch -p1, from the root of the translator checkout) to a copy of the checkout and builds the copy.

